{"id":"n79400-4-8","stage":2,"title":"줄기 · 束","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n79400-4-8-1","ko":"저 문에서 불빛 줄기가 나오는데 한번 가 보자.","zh":"那扇门后面有光柱冒出来，我们过去看看吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저","meaning":"那","explanation":"저：那","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71214","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}},{"text":"문에서","meaning":"门","explanation":"문：门；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"문","audio":"/audio/e2c7d5c49b61f5326c13.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"43832","senseId":"1","lemma":"문","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"문에서","audio":"/audio/9904c6133a606fe091ee.mp3"}},{"text":"불빛","meaning":"灯光","explanation":"불빛：灯光","readings":[{"term":"불빛","audio":"/audio/fa0d7fb8510db5921f34.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60673","senseId":"2","lemma":"불빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"불빛","audio":"/audio/fa0d7fb8510db5921f34.mp3"}},{"text":"줄기가","meaning":"束，丝，条","explanation":"줄기：束，丝，条；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"줄기","audio":"/audio/9aa7eeb0d6ac7f759ce7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79400","senseId":"4","lemma":"줄기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"줄기가","audio":"/audio/67ab0b01b6f6b675eef8.mp3"}},{"text":"나오는데","meaning":"出现，出来","explanation":"나오다：出现，出来；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"10","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나오는데","audio":"/audio/8cd1ed8fb4491469acb1.mp3"}},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceR